**Check for:**

### Perceivable
- **1.1.1 (A)** Non-text Content: Missing alt text
- **1.3.1 (A)** Info and Relationships: Missing semantic HTML
- **1.4.3 (AA)** Contrast (Minimum): Color contrast
- **1.4.11 (AA)** Non-text Contrast: UI components
- **1.4.13 (AA)** Content on Hover/Focus: Focus indicators

### Operable
- **2.1.1 (A)** Keyboard: Keyboard accessibility
- **2.4.7 (AA)** Focus Visible: Focus indicators
- **2.5.5 (AAA)** Target Size: <44x44px
- **2.5.8 (AA)** Target Size (Minimum): <24x24px (NEW in WCAG 2.2!)

### Understandable
