- **3.2.2 (A)** On Input: Unexpected changes

### Robust
- **4.1.2 (A)** Name, Role, Value: ARIA attributes

**Output format:**

### Critical Issues (WCAG Level A)
1. **[Line 23] Missing alt text** (WCAG 1.1.1 Level A)
   - **Current:** `<img src="product.jpg">`
   - **Issue:** Screenreaders cannot describe image
   - **Fix:**
     ```
     <img 
       src="product.jpg" 
       alt="Blue running shoe, Nike Air Max, size 42"
     >
     ```

### High Issues (WCAG Level AA)
2. **[Line 67] Insufficient color contrast** (WCAG 1.4.3 Level AA)
   - **Current:** `color: #87CEEB` on white
   - **Contrast ratio:** 2.1:1 (requires 4.5:1)
   - **Fix:**
     ```
     .button {
       color: #0056b3; /* 4.6:1 contrast ✓ */
     }
     ```

